\pard\sa200{\f2\fs28\b\cf2 2. Current Detection Pipeline Breakdown\par}

\pard\sa100{\f0\fs22\b Execution Workflow:\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20 1. \b Input Sanitization:\b0  Extracts hostname, removes `www.`, checks against top whitelist (~80 global domains).\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20 2. \b Static Rule Engine:\b0  Analyzes insecure HTTP (+20), phishing keywords (+50), and lookalike typosquatting (+30).\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20 3. \b WHOIS & RDAP Intel:\b0  Queries rdap.org / whoiser. Domains younger than 3 years add +20 risk points.\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20 4. \b Headless Browser Sandbox:\b0  Playwright launches headless Chromium (@sparticuz/chromium), waits for networkidle, checks password fields, and takes high-res screenshots.\par}
\pard\sa150\li720{\f0\fs20 5. \b Multimodal LLM Verdict:\b0  Sends screenshot + threat metadata to Gemini 1.5 Pro for MFA fatigue, brand impersonation, and social engineering analysis.\par}

\pard\sa100{\f0\fs22\b Risk Score & Status Classification:\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20\bullet  \b 0 - 30 (SAFE):\b0  Verified legitimate domain or clean heuristic record (\cf6 Emerald\cf0)\par}
\pard\sa100\li720{\f0\fs20\bullet  \b 31 - 69 (SUSPICIOUS):\b0  Moderate risk markers or new unverified registration (\cf7 Orange\cf0)\par}
\pard\sa200\li720{\f0\fs20\bullet  \b 70 - 100 (DANGEROUS):\b0  Confirmed brand impersonation or credential harvester (\cf3 Red\cf0)\par}

